        <detaileddescription>
<para>Ingest.</para>
<para>Pagination uses <computeroutput>ListObjectsV2</computeroutput> continuation tokens. Each listed object is downloaded (up to <computeroutput>max_concurrent_downloads</computeroutput> in parallel) and its content is extracted via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_file_system_ingester" kindref="compound">FileSystemIngester</ref></computeroutput>&apos;s format readers (for <computeroutput>.jsonl</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>.csv</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>.parquet</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>.<ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1ingestion_1ae9ea0122669d0fc6c47b1eb4f39f2325" kindref="member">json</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput>.txt</computeroutput>, etc.) or treated as raw text for unknown extensions.</para>
<para>When <computeroutput>THEMIS_ENABLE_S3</computeroutput> is not defined and no mock is injected, returns immediately with a <computeroutput>CONNECTOR_NOT_SUPPORTED</computeroutput> error.</para>
